      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1782975757163,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- 1 -> 3: slack (Persistence is Imp) (use-api-db)\n\n- 3 -> 2 WhatsApp (Persistence happens anyway or storage device) (speed is Imp) (use-ws-Kafka-db)\nso we said msg through WS and then async persist to DB , by doing batch write.\n\n- 3: for zoom that /where msg don't get persisted)",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- 1 -> 3: slack (Persistence is Imp) (use-api-db)\n\n- 3 -> 2 WhatsApp (Persistence happens anyway or storage device) (speed is Imp) (use-ws-Kafka-db)\nso we said msg through WS and then async persist to DB , by doing batch write.\n\n- 3: for zoom that /where msg don't get persisted)",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "U18cObKZOCypkwV3ojfKa",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -3740.395411141405,
      "y": 8181.4182267305805,
      "width": 1098.32763671875,
      "height": 105,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#b2f2bb",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
